化、机械工程等相关专业；​\n2. 3年以上直线导轨或精密机械传动产品的设计开发经验，熟悉直线导轨的工作原理、结构特性及设计标准（如ISO、JIS等）；​\n3. 具备扎实的机械设计基础知识，熟练运用CAD（AutoCAD/SolidWorks等）、CAE（ANSYS/Abaqus等）软件进行结构设计与仿真分析；​\n4. 了解直线导轨的加工工艺（如磨削、热处理、装配等），能从制造角度优化设计方案，降低生产成本；​\n5. 具备良好的问题解决能力和创新思维，能独立完成从需求分析到产品落地的设计全流程；​\n6. 工作严谨细致，有较强的责任心和团队协作精神，能适应一定的项目研发节奏。","ClassificationOne":null,"ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":"全职","Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-01-20T18:24:57","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null,"RewardText":null,"IsTop":false,"Cash":0,"CashText":null,"HideCash":false,"Score":0,"ScoreText":null,"HideScore":false,"HrDutyUser":null,"DutyUserId":0,"JobId":0,"RewardImgUrl":null,"RewardAttUrl":null,"RewardAttName":null,"JobAdNameWithoutJobCode":null,"Distance":null},{"Id":"1b300d25-6331-4314-89d1-585fd665d65b","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":351527026,"PostDateInt":1768899656000,"PostDate":"2026-01-20T17:00:56","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"项目经理（机电一体）","OrgId":86137,"Org":"机械传动开发部","Category":"社会招聘","CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":["江苏省·南京市"],"Salary":"15K-25K 元/月","Duty":"1. 理解IPD开发流程，掌握项目管理方法。统筹电缸机电一体化项目的全生命周期管理，包括需求调研、方案设计（机械结构+电气控制）、样机试制、测试验证、批量生产及客户交付；​\n2. 项目Charter阶段，以项目代表参与CDT项目规划，协调机械、电气、控制等跨领域团队协作，解决项目中机械结构与电气控制的集成问题；​\n3. 对接客户进行技术交流，明确机电一体化系统的性能指标（如精度、负载、控制方式等），确保方案满足客户实际应用场景；​\n4. 制定项目进度计划，跟踪关键节点，识别并解决项目中的技术风险与资源冲突，保障项目高效推进；​\n5. 主导项目管理和业务流程规则部分模块的的建设优化。总结项目经验，优化电缸机电一体化产品的研发与生产流程，提升项目交付效率。","Require":"1. 本科及以上学历，机械电子，工程、机电一体化、自动化等相关专业；\n2. 3年以上电缸或机电一体化产品的项目管理经验，熟悉电缸的机械结构设计、电机选型、控制系统（如PLC、运动控制卡）编程与调试；​\n3. 具备扎实的机械设计知识（如结构强度、传动原理）与电气控制基础（如电路设计、伺服系统应用），了解机电集成方案设计；​\n4. 具备优秀的项目统筹能力与跨部门协作能力，有成功交付定制化机电一体化项目经验者优先；\n​5. 熟悉项目管理工具（如MS Project、Jira），持有PMP证书者优先。","ClassificationOne":null,"ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":"全职","Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":"本科","YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-01-20T17:00:56","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null,"RewardText":null,"IsTop":false,"Cash":0,"CashText":null,"HideCash":false,"Score":0,"ScoreText":null,"HideScore":false,"HrDutyUser":null,"DutyUserId":0,"JobId":0,"RewardImgUrl":null,"RewardAttUrl":null,"RewardAttName":null,"JobAdNameWithoutJobCode":null,"Distance":null}],"Total":0}